\f2\b0\fs28 \cf0 This {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://opengrads.org"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 OpenGrADS}} version is based on COLA's 2.2.1 release with minimum updates in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://opengrads.org"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 OpenGrADS}} extensions. \
As for the new functionality in the COLA release of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://cola.gmu.edu/grads/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 GrADS}} v2.2.1 we quote from Jennifer Adams' announcement from 26 April 2018: 
\i \
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\ri0\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\b\fs36 \cf0 Features:
\f2\i\b0\fs28 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\ri0\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl1\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}GrADS is officially 30 years old\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}New Python interface called GradsPy\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Major configuration changes; all supplibs now linked dynamically\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Added support for ^ and $ at the beginning of a shared object filename in UDPT entries\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Added support for an optional fourth arg in UDPT entry for a function name alias\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Added support for netcdf attributes of type STRING	\
\pard\pardeftab720\li720\ri0\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\i0\b\fs36 \cf0 Bug Fixes
\f2\i\b0 :
\fs28 	\
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\ri0\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl1\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Fixed bug in gr2stn() when station expression returns a NULL result\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Fixed bug in 'set misswarn' when no files are open\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Prevents attempts to use non-Hershey fonts when using the classic graphics plug-ins (X11/gd) \
